# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore for Dockerfile.vllm-cuda.
# The runtime stage COPYs the pre-built -Pdist-vllm distribution from the host
# (gravitee-singularitee-standalone/.../target/distribution), so that one path must
# stay in the build context; every other target/ is just bloat.
.git
**/target
# Keep only the assembled standalone distribution (exclude the rest of its target/,
# notably the ~1.2GB distribution.zip, archive-tmp, site).
!gravitee-singularitee-standalone/gravitee-singularitee-standalone-distribution/target
gravitee-singularitee-standalone/gravitee-singularitee-standalone-distribution/target/*
!gravitee-singularitee-standalone/gravitee-singularitee-standalone-distribution/target/distribution
logs
*.log
.idea
*.iml
.run
aws
helm
docs
**/*.md
